### Horizontal scaling

> Implement horizontal scaling for the existing Yjs collaboration server.

The application should support running multiple server instances simultaneously.

Users connected to different server instances must be able to edit the same document collaboratively in real time, with changes synchronized across instances.

#### Requirements:
- Support at least two server instances running locally.
- Preserve existing editor functionality.
- Keep document updates synchronized across instances.
- Ensure user awareness (presence and cursors) works across instances.
- Preserve existing authentication, permissions, and document persistence behavior.
- Handle client disconnections, reconnections, and server restarts.
- Provide instructions for running and testing the multi-server setup locally.
- Add automated tests covering collaboration between instances.

Implement the feature and verify that it works.